hase 3 can run in parallel → run sequentially (headless mode).\n- Skip all \'ask user\' or \'wait for confirmation\' steps — auto-proceed.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current Task\n- **Feature**: anonymous-login-optimization\n- **Workflow**: wf_feature_research\n- **Workspace**: /home/nguyentthai96/Desktop/bigbang/boilerplate/services/auth-service\n\n### Pipeline Progress\n- Status: running\n- Completed: 0 features\n- Failed: 0 features\n- Total tokens used: 0\n\n### 📋 Output Templates (MUST FOLLOW)\n\n**CRITICAL INSTRUCTION**: For each output file, you MUST follow the exact structure and section hierarchy shown in the corresponding template below. Replace {{PLACEHOLDER}} values with actual content. Do NOT invent your own structure — use these templates verbatim.\n\n**OUTPUT FORMAT**: For each file, output a write_file JSON tool call:\n```\n{"name": "write_file", "arguments": {"path": "<workspace>/openspec/research/anonymous-login-optimization/<filename>.md", "content": "<complete file content>"}}\n```\n\n⚠️ **ANTI-ECHO RULES** (CRITICAL — VIOLATION WASTES OUTPUT TOKENS):\n1. Do NOT echo or repeat template content in your response.\n2. Do NOT output analysis text, thinking, or validation checklists.\n3. Do NOT write \'Phase 1 validation:\' or similar self-narration.\n4. ONLY output write_file JSON tool calls — nothing else.\n5. Each write_file must contain COMPLETE file content (not templates).\n6. Templates below are REFERENCE ONLY — read them, then output files.\n\n#### Template for `business_analysis.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Tài liệu phân tích nghiệp vụ: {{FEATURE_NAME}}\n\n> Phân tích nghiệp vụ chi tiết — chia nhỏ theo use case, đặc tả ngữ nghĩa từng chức năng.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Tổng quan (Overview)\n\n### 1.1 Bối cảnh nghiệp vụ (Business Context)\n<!-- Tại sao tính năng này cần tồn tại? Bài toán business gì? -->\n\n### 1.2 Mục tiêu (Objectives)\n<!-- Mục tiêu business cần đạt -->\n\n| # | Mục tiêu | KPI đo lường | Độ ưu tiên |\n|---|---------|-------------|-----------|\n| O-01 