ork routes, tests). With an entrypoint argument, returns the call tree.', 'input_schema': {'additionalProperties': False, 'properties': {'depth': {'description': 'Maximum DFS depth (default 5, max 10).', 'type': 'number'}, 'entrypoint': {'description': 'Symbol name to trace from. Omit to list auto-detected entry points.', 'type': 'string'}, 'file': {'description': 'Optional file hint to disambiguate the symbol.', 'type': 'string'}, 'projectPath': {'description': 'Absolute path to the project directory.', 'type': 'string'}}, 'type': 'object'}}, {'name': 'mcp_socraticode_codebase_graph_build', 'description': '[MCP:socraticode] Build a dependency graph of the codebase using static analysis (ast-grep). Maps import/require/export relationships between files. Runs in the background — call codebase_graph_status to poll progress until complete.', 'input_schema': {'additionalProperties': False, 'properties': {'extraExtensions': {'description': "Comma-separated list of additional file extensions to include in the graph (e.g. '.tpl,.blade'). Files with non-standard extensions are included as leaf nodes (dependency targets). Can also be set globally via EXTRA_EXTENSIONS env var.", 'type': 'string'}, 'projectPath': {'description': 'Absolute path to the project directory.', 'type': 'string'}}, 'type': 'object'}}, {'name': 'mcp_socraticode_codebase_graph_circular', 'description': '[MCP:socraticode] Find circular dependencies in the codebase.', 'input_schema': {'additionalProperties': False, 'properties': {'projectPath': {'description': 'Absolute path to the project directory.', 'type': 'string'}}, 'type': 'object'}}, {'name': 'mcp_socraticode_codebase_graph_query', 'description': '[MCP:socraticode] Query the code dependency graph for a specific file. Returns what the file imports and what files depend on it.', 'input_schema': {'additionalProperties': False, 'properties': {'filePath': {'description': "Relative path of the file to query (e.g. 'src/index.ts').", 'type': 'string'}, 'p