lusive). Optional.'}}, 'required': ['path']}}, {'name': 'list_dir', 'description': 'List contents of a directory. Returns file names, sizes, and types. Use relative_workspace_path for paths relative to workspace root.', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Directory path. Can be absolute or relative to workspace.'}}, 'required': ['path']}}, {'name': 'grep_search', 'description': 'Search for a pattern in files. Returns matching lines with file paths and line numbers. Supports regex and case-insensitive search.', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'query': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Search pattern (literal string or regex).'}, 'path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Directory or file path to search in. Relative to workspace or absolute.'}, 'is_regex': {'type': 'boolean', 'description': 'If true, treat query as regex. Default: false.'}, 'case_insensitive': {'type': 'boolean', 'description': 'If true, case-insensitive search. Default: false.'}, 'file_pattern': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Glob pattern to filter files, e.g. '*.py', '*.ts'. Optional."}}, 'required': ['query']}}, {'name': 'glob_search', 'description': "Find files matching a glob pattern within the workspace. Returns file paths relative to workspace root. Supports patterns like '**/*.py', '*.md', 'src/**/*.ts'. Max 100 results.", 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'pattern': {'type': 'string', 'description': "Glob pattern (e.g., '**/*.py', '*.md')."}, 'path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Base directory for the search. Relative to workspace or absolute. Default: workspace root.'}}, 'required': ['pattern']}}, {'name': 'write_file', 'description': 'Create or overwrite a file with the given content. Parent directories are created automatically. Path must be within the workspace directory.', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'File path to write. Relative to workspace or absolute (must be within workspace).'}, 'content': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'File content to write.'}}, 'required': ['path', 'content']}}, {'name': 'edit_file', 'description': 'Edit an existing file by replacing target content with new content. The target_content must exactly match text in the file. Path must be within the workspace directory.', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'File path to edit.'}, 'target_content': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Exact text to find and replace. Must match file content exactly.'}, 'replacement_content': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'New text to replace the target with.'}}, 'required': ['path', 'target_content', 'replacement_content']}}, {'name': 'delete_file', 'description': 'Delete a file or directory within the workspace. Protected paths (.git, node_modules, __pycache__, .env) cannot be deleted. Path must be within the workspace directory.', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'path': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Path to delete. Relative to workspace or absolute (must be within workspace).'}}, 'required': ['path']}}, {'name': 'run_command', 'description': 'Execute a shell command in the workspace directory. Only allowed commands can be run (sandboxed). Output is capped at 10,000 characters. Timeout: 60 seconds.', 'input_schema': {'type': 'object', 'properties': {'command': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Shell command to execute.'}, 'cwd': {'type': 'string', 'description': 'Working directory for the command. Relative to workspace or absolute. Optional.'}}, 'required': ['command']}}, {'name': 'ddg_search', 'description': 'Search the web using DuckDuckGo for additional results. Use this as a SUPPLEMENT to the built-in web_search tool when you need more search results or different perspectives. Returns JSON array of results with title, href, and body snippet. No API key required.', 'input_schema': {'type': 'obje